<title>USA: Cable &amp; Co names top executives.</title>
<headline>Cable &amp; Co names top executives.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable &amp; Co Worldwide Inc said Monday that it has named Alan Kandall president and chief executive officer, replacing David Albahari, who resigned.</p>
<p>Kandall was previously chief operating officer and chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Calbe &amp; Co named Joel Brooks, formerly comptroller, chief financial officer and treasurer of the company.</p>
